-- Even sets and even covers across a split, a vertex set crossed by no edge:
-- an even set of one side is even in the whole graph, covers of the two
-- sides join, and a cover found with the end functions restricted to a side
-- is a cover for the original ends.
-- Part of Cumulus, the Grace17 mathematics library.
-- Copyright (c) 2026 Grant Passmore.
